{{!-- src/web/views/pages/standalone-message.hbs

  TEMPASI_STANDALONE_PAGE_LAYOUT (2026-08-15)

  Shared view for small, one-off confirmation/status pages that used
  to be built as bare `<!doctype html>` strings sent directly via
  res.send() — no site header/footer, just a floating block of text
  on an otherwise blank page. Route handlers now call
  renderStandalonePage(req, res, { title, bodyHtml, ... }) instead,
  which renders THIS view through the normal layout (same one every
  other page on the site uses), so header/footer/nav show up
  automatically.

  bodyHtml is raw, pre-built HTML (already escaped by the caller where
  it includes user data) — rendered with triple-stache since it's
  trusted server-generated markup, not user input passed through
  unescaped.
--}}
<section class="standalone-page">
  <div class="standalone-page__panel">
    {{{bodyHtml}}}
  </div>
</section>
